# Failover Validation

## Static route and HSRP failover


R6# sh ip route 10.40.0.0
R6# sh track 60
R10# sh standby br
R11# sh standby br


Shut the primary path:

R6# conf t
R6(config)# int s2/2
R6(config-if)# shut
R6(config-if)# end


Verify:


R6# sh ip route 10.40.0.0
R6# sh track 60
R10# sh standby br
R11# sh standby br


Restore:


R6# conf t
R6(config)# int s2/2
R6(config-if)# no shut
R6(config-if)# end


## BGP Internet failover

Before failure:


R29# sh ip route 0.0.0.0
R32# sh ip route 0.0.0.0
R30# sh ip bgp 0.0.0.0
R31# sh ip bgp 0.0.0.0


Shut the primary Internet link:


R30# conf t
R30(config)# int e0/0
R30(config-if)# shut
R30(config-if)# end


Verify:


R29# sh ip route 0.0.0.0
R32# sh ip route 0.0.0.0
R31# sh ip bgp 0.0.0.0
R31# sh ip route 0.0.0.0


Restore:


R30# conf t
R30(config)# int e0/0
R30(config-if)# no shut
R30(config-if)# end


